od's level. Additionally levels up some abilities of creeps by 1 level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_units", "level_req", "health_min", "gold_pct", "movement_speed_bonus", "damage_bonus", "creep_ability_level", "unsummon_time", "unsummon_cooldown_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_spectral_dagger", "name_zh": "幽鬼·幽鬼之刃", "name_en": "Spectral Dagger", "description_zh": "幽鬼掷出一把匕首，留下一条暗影之径，对路径上的敌人造成伤害并减缓其移动速度。被匕首击中的单位移动时也会留下暗影之径。幽鬼在暗影之径上移速提升，并且可以无视地形移动。", "description_en": "Spectre flings a dagger to draw a Shadow Path, dealing damage and slowing the movement speed of any enemies along the trail. Units hit by the dagger also trail a Shadow Path. While treading the path, Spectre moves faster and phases through otherwise impassable terrain.", "notes_zh": ["在离开暗影之径后%dagger_grace_period%秒内碰撞体积依然为0，作为缓冲时间。", "不会触发法术抵抗或法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "bonus_movespeed", "dagger_path_duration", "hero_path_duration", "buff_persistence", "dagger_radius", "path_radius", "vision_radius", "speed", "dagger_grace_period", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_shadow_step", "name_zh": "幽鬼·如影随形", "name_en": "Shadow Step", "description_zh": "对目标制造一个无法控制的幻象，对其进行攻击。子技能空降可以将本体传送至幻象，并将其摧毁。", "description_en": "Sends an uncontrollable illusion at a target that follows and attacks the target.The Reality sub-ability may be used to teleport to the illusion, destroying it.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "illusion_damage_incoming", "tooltip_illusion_total_damage_incoming", "illusion_outgoing_damage", "move_speed", "bonus_move_speed_illusion_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_scorched_earth", "name_zh": "末日使者·焦土", "name_en": "Scorched Earth", "description_zh": "用火焰覆盖周围的土地，对敌人造成伤害，同时末日使者的移动速度和生命恢复得到提升。", "description_en": "Carpets the nearby earth in flames which damage enemies, while also granting Doom increased movement speed and health regeneration.", "notes_zh": ["焦土会跟随末日使者，以他所在位置为中心。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_second", "bonus_health_regen", "radius", "bonus_movement_speed_pct", "duration", "is_permanent", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_ice_vortex", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·冰霜漩涡", "name_en": "Ice Vortex", "description_zh": "创造一个寒冰能量的漩涡，对范围内敌人造成伤害和减速，并增加他们受到的魔法伤害。", "description_en": "Creates a vortex of icy energy that slows, deals damage, and increases magic damage done to enemies in its range.", "notes_zh": ["提供放置地点的小片视野。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "drag_speed", "movement_speed_pct", "spell_resist_pct", "vision_aoe", "damage_per_second", "vortex_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ursa_overpower", "name_zh": "熊战士·超强力量", "name_en": "Overpower", "description_zh": "乌尔萨在战斗中运用他的技艺，提升了接下来几次攻击的攻击速度，同时还获得了减速抗性。", "description_en": "Using his skill in combat, Ursa gains increased attack speed and slow resistance for a number of subsequent attacks.", "notes_zh": ["攻击丢失还是会消耗超强力量的攻击次数。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_attacks", "attack_speed_bonus_pct", "slow_resist", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_charge_of_darkness", "name_zh": "裂魂人·暗影冲刺", "name_en": "Charge of Darkness", "description_zh": "裂魂人盯紧一个敌方单位，开始无视一切物体的冲刺，起始为%min_movespeed_bonus_pct%%%额外移速，%windup_time%秒后达到最大速度。途中经过的所有敌方单位和目标单位都将受到巨力重击。如果目标单位在到达前阵亡，裂魂人将他的目标改为原路径上最近的一个敌方单位。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker fixes his sight on an enemy unit and starts charging through all objects, starting at %min_movespeed_bonus_pct%%% of the bonus speed and reaching his max speed after %windup_time%s.All enemy units passed through and the targeted unit will be hit by a Greater Bash.  If the targeted unit dies, Spirit Breaker will change his target to the nearest enemy unit to that location.", "notes_zh": ["裂魂人在冲刺过程中能穿过树木，悬崖和任何单位。", "冲刺指示特效仅对队友可见。", "裂魂人将获得并共享目标的视野。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed", "stun_duration", "bash_radius", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "windup_time", "min_movespeed_bonus_pct", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_bulldoze", "name_zh": "裂魂人·威吓", "name_en": "Bulldoze", "description_zh": "裂魂人获得移动速度和状态抗性加成，在敌人之间横冲直撞。可以在冲刺期间使用。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker gains movement speed and status resistance to ram through enemies. Can be used while charging.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed", "status_resistance", "duration", "damage_barrier", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_greater_bash", "name_zh": "裂魂人·巨力重击", "name_en": "Greater Bash", "description_zh": "攻击时有一定概率眩晕并击退敌方单位。重击的伤害值为移动速度的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Gives a chance to stun and knockback an enemy unit on an attack. Deals a percentage of movement speed as damage.", "notes_zh": ["不与碎颅锤叠加。", "破坏会使攻击触发巨力重击失效。暗影冲刺或幽冥一击还是会施加巨力重击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "击退效果提升。如果击退的敌人又撞到了一个敌人，这个敌人也会被重击（非英雄单位只受到%cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%%伤害），并且原目标再次受到%cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%%的巨力重击伤害。", "en": "Increases knockback. If a knocked-back enemy collides with another enemy, the second enemy is bashed (creeps only receive %cascading_bashes_creep_penalty%%% damage), and the original target takes %cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier%%% of Greater Bash's damage again."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["chance_pct", "bonus_chance_pct", "bonus_chance_duration", "damage", "duration", "knockback_duration", "cascading_bash_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_damage_multiplier", "cascading_bashes_creep_penalty", "cascading_bashes_nether_strike_additional_cooldown", "cascading_bashes_hero_hitbox", "cascading_bashes_creep_hitbox", "knockback_distance", "knockback_height", "bonus_knockback_multiplier"]}, {"subject": "spirit_breaker_bull_rush", "name_zh": "裂魂人·神行太保", "name_en": "Empowering Haste", "description_zh": "裂魂人只要眩晕敌人就会获得移动速度加成。来自多个眩晕的效果会叠加，并且拥有独立的持续时间。暗影冲刺期间持续时间会暂停。", "description_en": "Spirit Breaker gains bonus Movement Speed for a duration whenever he stuns an enemy. Effects from multiple stuns stack and have independent durations. Duration pauses during Charge of Darkness.", "notes_zh": ["神行太保的加成状态使裂魂人能够突破移动速度上限。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["hero_duration", "creep_duration", "hero_movespeed_percent", "creep_movespeed_percent"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_homing_missile", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·追踪导弹", "name_en": "Homing Missile", "description_zh": "发射一枚会自动定位目标单位的追踪导弹。导弹发射后持续增加飞行速度，击中目标时造成伤害及眩晕。敌方单位可在导弹接近前将其击落。", "description_en": "Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.", "notes_zh": ["防御塔对导弹造成半额伤害。", "准星效果仅对队友可见。", "导弹会跟随并击中隐身单位。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "追踪导弹现在从施放%shard_delay%秒后开始不断发射%shard_radius%作用范围的火箭弹幕。火箭弹幕优先以追踪导弹的目标为目标。", "en": "Homing Missiles now constantly fires the current level of Rocket Barrage in a %shard_radius% area of effect after %shard_delay% second of being cast. This Rocket Barrage prioritizes the Homing Missile target."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hits_to_kill_tooltip", "tower_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "stun_duration", "attack_speed_bonus_pct", "hit_damage", "max_distance", "pre_flight_time", "hero_damage", "speed", "acceleration", "enemy_vision_time", "shard_delay", "shard_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_afterburner", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·加力燃烧器", "name_en": "Afterburner", "description_zh": "矮人直升机通过攻击或技能对敌人造成伤害后，在短时间内获得移动速度提升。", "description_en": "Gyrocopter gains movement speed for a short duration after damaging an enemy with his attacks or abilities.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_movespeed_duration", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit", "bonus_movement_speed_per_hit_creep"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_unstable_concoction", "name_zh": "炼金术士·不稳定化合物", "name_en": "Unstable Concoction", "description_zh": "炼金术士调制一瓶不稳定的化合物，投向敌方英雄，对爆炸点周边范围的单位造成伤害并眩晕。调制的时间越久，伤害越大，眩晕时间也越长。炼金术士在调制期间获得移动速度加成。调制%brew_time%秒后达到最大伤害量和最长眩晕时间。然而，若%brew_explosion%秒后未扔出药剂，则会在炼金术士自己手中爆炸。", "description_en": "Alchemist brews up an unstable concoction that he can throw at an enemy hero, to stun and deal damage in an area around the explosion. The longer the concoction brews, the more damage it deals and the longer the stun. Alchemist is faster while charging the concoction. After %brew_time% seconds, the brew reaches its maximum damage and stun time. However, after %brew_explosion% seconds, the concoction will explode on Alchemist himself if not thrown.", "notes_zh": ["摇制开始后，本技能替换为投掷不稳定化合物。炼金术士在摇制期间可以像平常一样移动和攻击。", "炼金术士的头顶会有倒计时，提示剩余的摇制时间。倒计时对敌人可见。", "可以用此技能将自己反补。", "不稳定化合物无法被躲避，并且不稳定化合物被掷出后会停止调制。", "不稳定化合物的爆炸会对英雄和非英雄单位造成伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["brew_time", "brew_explosion", "min_stun", "max_stun", "max_damage", "radius", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_berserk_potion", "name_zh": "炼金术士·狂暴药剂", "name_en": "Berserk Potion", "description_zh": "炼金术士向友军目标扔出一瓶药剂，施加弱驱散效果，并提供攻击速度、移动速度和生命恢复。驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist throws a potion at an ally, applying a basic dispel and giving them attack speed, movement speed and HP regen.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "attack_speed", "hp_regen", "projectile_speed", "move_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "alchemist_chemical_rage", "name_zh": "炼金术士·化学狂暴", "name_en": "Chemical Rage", "description_zh": "炼金术士诱发他的食人魔同伴进入化学狂暴，降低攻击间隔，提高移动速度和生命恢复。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Alchemist causes his Ogre to enter a chemically induced rage, reducing base attack cooldown and increasing movement speed and health regeneration.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["拥有%transformation_time%秒的变身时间，可以用来躲避攻击和技能弹道以及眩晕技能。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "transformation_time", "base_attack_time", "bonus_health_regen", "bonus_movespeed", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "invoker_wex", "name_zh": "祈求者·雷", "name_en": "Wex", "description_zh": "允许祈求者掌控雷元素。每个活跃的雷元素会让祈求者获得移动和攻击速度加成。每级雷被动提供额外敏捷。", "description_en": "Allows manipulation of storm elements. Active Wex instances imbue Invoker with bonus movement and attack speed. Passively grants bonus agility per level of Wex.", "notes_zh": ["祈求者最多只有3个球。", "不会打破隐身状态，而且可以在持续施法期间施放。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提供%scepter_bonus_levels%级当前和最高等级。", "en": "Grants %scepter_bonus_levels% current and max level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_level", "move_speed_per_instance", "attack_speed_per_instance", "upgrade_at_level", "agility_bonus", "scepter_bonus_levels", "facet_bonus_levels"]}]
